-Liked Heroes of Might and Magic;
-Liked any other game from the series.
First game from all the "modern" King's Bounties, still replayable 8 years after, shares the 1st place with the Armored Princess for the title of the best game in KB series.
If you ever wondered what is KB -- buy this game. Don't look for the newer ones.
